//
// Result: [ ] No transport rule creation or modification detected — no evidence of silent external mail forwarding established at tenant level
//         [ ] Results found — see findings below
//
// Findings:
//   Initiating account:
//   Rule name / operation:
//   External redirect target(s):
//   Timeframe:
//   Notes:
//
// Conclusion:
//   [ ] No suspicious activity identified — transport rule change confirmed as an approved change (e.g. change ticket, planned mail-flow work)
//   [ ] Suspicious activity identified — escalating
//   [ ] False positive — reason:
